jobs.prompt:
Ticket T-8012 (owner-approved Swarm Watch card, data part; UI is T-8013 later). This branch already has T-8010 (boardPercent, tests/helpers/board-accuracy-fixture.mjs) and T-8011 (family activity, lastTicketFinishedAt, checkouts, activity state, installed version, Finished). Add to projectOverview in tools/board-data.mjs a `card` object with EXACTLY these fields (the UI codes against this shape):
card.now = { buildingTickets: number of tickets with status running across the family ledgers, checkoutsBuilding: number of family checkouts with a live run, lastTicketFinishedAt (from T-8011) }
card.next = { ready: tickets whose status is ready or todo AND every dependsOn ticket is done (use readyTickets from tools/tickets.mjs if it implements this), items: [{ id, title, command: 'swarm tickets ID' }] }
card.blocked = { waitingOnTickets: tickets blocked only because a dependsOn ticket is not done, items: [{ id, title, waitsOn: [ids], command: 'swarm tickets ID --release' only when the ledger rule allows release, else null }], needYou: count of need-you items, needYouItems: [{ id, title, kind, command }] from tools/board-inbox.mjs (add 'swarm tickets ID --release' to nextFor in board-inbox.mjs for blocked tickets whose block reason is a hold the owner can release) }
card.slots = { machineMax, inUse, byThisProject (slots held by this project's family ids), byOtherProjects } from workersHeld / lanes.json (tools/board-data.mjs ~646-671) so a UI line can say 'all 8 machine slots in use (5 by other projects)' and never contradict building
card.eta = { days or null, remaining: counted not-done tickets (same set as the percent), perDay: tickets done per day over the last 7 days, doneLast7Days, windowDays: 7, basis: short sentence } computed from tickets.log done transitions in the family; null days when perDay is 0 (never invent)
card.facts = { handEditsBlocked24h: guard refusals ('blocked' events in .swarm/orchestrator/events.ndjson) in the last 24 hours (not all time), untrackedRuns: offLedgerRuns count (smoke/lane-test/probe/nonIntegrating excluded) with listHref, checkouts }
card.headsUp = one plain sentence or null describing the worst current problem, e.g. 'Stage S9 has 3 tickets that write the same file in the same wave, so they cannot run together.' built from split-quality collisions or under-filled waves; null for Finished projects.
NO money fields at all (owner rule). Tests in tests/board-accuracy-card.test.mjs using makeBoardFixture: one test per field, each expected value computed by an oracle that reads the fixture's files from disk (ledger, tickets.log, lanes.json, events.ndjson, run files), never by calling board functions; include a fixture where other projects hold slots, one with a dependency chain, one with a held ticket, one with guard events older and newer than 24 h, and one with a same-file wave collision. Do NOT touch tools/swarm.mjs, the tools/swarm folder, package files, .github or the board browser scripts. Run `node --import ./tests/_isolate-config.mjs --test --test-timeout=60000 tests/board-accuracy-card.test.mjs tests/board-accuracy-*.test.mjs tests/board-*.test.mjs` and `node tools/check-package.mjs`.
